  "body": "Set Date Sale\r\nBy 04 December 2026 at 12pm\r\n(Unless Sold Prior)\r\n\r\nThis beautifully designed impressive home offers approx. 311sqm of floor area on approx. 604sqm of freehold land, combining generous family living with the flexibility of a legal income.\r\n\r\nThe fully independent two-bedroom legal income features its own private entrance, kitchen, living area and bathroom - ideal for extended family or generating additional rental income.\r\n\r\nThe main residence offers spacious open-plan living, premium kitchen appliances, a fully equipped second kitchen, central air-conditioning and built-in audio. Two master suites each feature a walk-in wardrobe and their own deck access, while multiple living areas and generous outdoor spaces provide plenty of room to relax and entertain.\r\n\r\nProperty Highlights\r\n* Brand new Legal Home & Income\r\n* Approx. 311sqm floor area | 604sqm freehold land\r\n* Two master suites with walk-in wardrobes & deck access\r\n* Miele appliances & second kitchen\r\n* Central air-conditioning & built-in audio\r\n* Double garage\r\n\r\nPerfectly positioned close to the growing Silverdale Centre, shopping, motorway access, beaches and everyday amenities - convenience without compromising on a peaceful residential lifestyle.\r\n\r\nContact Ray 022 158 3320 or Harper 021 662 778 today for more information or to arrange your private viewing.",
